secutive years, raising it 6.2% a year over the last five."],"people":["With about 67,400 employees, each generates about $500K of revenue, 1.4x the Industrials median, and productivity has risen 7.4% a year.","That works out to $35K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $8.6M (17x revenue per employee).","Stock compensation averages $1K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"WATCH","conv":73,"head":"Watch: LEAN BUY-rated, but no margin of safety; it becomes a buy below $370.","pros":["Model rating LEAN BUY (composite 50, gates 11/26)","ROIC 19.6% vs WACC 9.1%","Revenue grew 11.2%/yr over 5y","Net debt/EBITDA 0.7x","Altman Z in the safe zone"],"cons":["Trades 3% above fair value of $436"],"flags":[],"need":["no margin of safety"],"buy_below":370.21,"vc":{"base":435.54,"base_src":"dcf","bear":280.42,"bull":671.12,"alt_median":284.85,"n_alt":3,"gap":0.529,"dispersion":0.2277,"level":"LOW","why":["DCF is 53% above the other models' median ($285)"]},"med":{"pe":23.2692,"ev_ebitda":13.319,"pfcf":22.2778,"pb":3.0551,"roic":0.1001,"gross_margin":0.2851,"fcf_margin":0.068,"div_yield":0.0147}},"ticker":"CMI","date":"2026-11-06"}